      <activity id="7d87afc2-6f73-5efc-9d84-eed8474014d9" activityNameId="0e97e493-cbb4-5ece-8d34-d8a69a5c1c2c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 3500 m3/h, modular</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 3500 m3/h, modular
Disposal of a silencer for a air handling unit with 3500 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), total weight: 115 kg/Unit, including a frame construction, casing, silencer baffle with section length 900mm. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam, rock wool as sound-absorbing media.;
UUID: cdab6388-4019-41c3-a650-e003efaddffd
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cdab6388-4019-41c3-a650-e003efaddffd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
